{"seq":2,"slug":"stellar-physics","title":"恒星物理学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 恒星物理学\n\n恒星物理学是天体物理学的核心分支，研究恒星的内部结构、能量产生机制、演化过程及终态。从分子云中的引力坍缩到最终的白矮星、中子星或黑洞，恒星的一生贯穿了核物理、流体力学、辐射转移和广义相对论等多个物理学领域。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 Hub 按恒星生命周期的逻辑组织为四个章节：\n\n1. **恒星结构与演化** — 流体静力平衡、核聚变能源机制、赫罗图上的演化轨迹\n2. **恒星终态** — 白矮星的电子简并、中子星与脉冲星、恒星级黑洞的形成\n3. **双星与变星** — 双星系统的质量转移、变星分类与宇宙距离阶梯、新星与超新星物理\n4. **恒星形成** — 分子云坍缩的金斯不稳定性、原恒星演化阶段、初始质量函数\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基础经典力学与热力学\n- 原子核物理基础（结合能、隧穿效应）\n- 电磁辐射与光谱学基本概念\n\n## 核心参考\n\n| 资源                                                                | 说明                 |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| Kippenhahn, Weigert & Weiss《Stellar Structure and Evolution》      | 恒星内部结构经典教材 |\n| Hansen, Kawaler & Trimble《Stellar Interiors》                      | 侧重物理推导         |\n| Shapiro & Teukolsky《Black Holes, White Dwarfs, and Neutron Stars》 | 致密天体物理         |\n| Stahler & Palla《The Formation of Stars》                           | 恒星形成标准参考     |\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stellar-structure-evolution","title":"恒星结构与演化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydrostatic-equilibrium","title":"流体静力平衡与恒星结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/hydrostatic-equilibrium"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nuclear-fusion-processes","title":"核聚变过程：pp链与CNO循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/nuclear-fusion-processes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stellar-evolution-tracks","title":